			"strokeColor": "#c9d1d9",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"text": "📖 uv is a fast Python package manager (alternative to pip).\nuv sync reads pyproject.toml, downloads all dependencies\n(numpy, pydantic, llm-sdk) and installs them into .venv/.\nRun this once when you first clone the project.",
