			"strokeColor": "#c9d1d9",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"text": "📖 uv run runs a command inside the .venv environment\n(so it uses the correct Python + dependencies).\n\npython -m src means \"run the src/ folder as a module\"\n→ Python executes src/__main__.py which starts the pipeline.",
