			"strokeColor": "#c9d1d9",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"text": "📖 pdb = Python DeBugger. This runs the same pipeline but\ninside an interactive debugger.\n\nIt pauses at breakpoints (or exceptions) and lets you inspect\nvariables, step through code line-by-line, and understand\nwhat's happening.\n\nSame as make run but with a magnifying glass 🔍.",
