			"width": 334.31982421875,
			"height": 112.5,
			"strokeColor": "#c9d1d9",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"text": "📖 rm = reMove, -rf = \"recursive force\" (delete folders +\ntheir contents, don't ask).\n\n__pycache__ = Python bytecode cache (auto-generated .pyc files)\n.mypy_cache = mypy's type-checking cache\n.pytest_cache = pytest's test run cache\n\nThese are all auto-generated — safe to delete, they'll\nbe recreated when needed.",
			"fontSize": 10,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"id": "VflQTZld",
			"roughness": 0,
